        },
        {
          "text": " Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio ebe: “Kogogoŋoto akusikanin, yes luipupete kapaarasia kanu akiro nu nuepote kaituke nuka inabin, luajaas kapaaran naapesikinere apetetait naka etogo loka EJAKAIT loka ajoresio, tetere edukio eyekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai eriŋa kedolo apaarasia ŋun amamei eropit loka ituŋanan, karaida eropit loka etiaŋ; amamei da ainapakin nol loaloman ka loalomuni kanuka lokasurup: naarai abu ketuluik ŋinituŋanan kekeidunyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye ebala EJAKAIT loka ajoresio ebe, Mam kwana ekoni nen mama ejai aatoŋot naka ituŋa lu kwape kapaarasia nukolono, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
