        {
          "text": "“lnera kwanata EJAKAIT loka aioresio ebe: Ailuŋ naka elap lokiwononet, ka ailuŋ naka lokikanyet, ka ailuŋ naka lokikanyetekaarei, ka ailuŋ naka lokitomonet eraunos ipucin lukailel ka lukaiyalama, ka lukalakara mama ejai ekek loka Yuda: kanuka ŋun kominas abeit ka ainapakin.",
