              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio atiar: Epote teni atekerin, ka luibojete koreria luipu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "luibojete kore ediopet elosete ore ece, kinerasi ebe, ‘Karurukaros aimaimaun asianut naka EJAKAIT, ka amoun EJAKAIT loka ajoresio: alosi eoŋ da.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eebo, epote ituŋa luipu ka atekerin nuegogoŋ amoun EJAKAIT loka aioresio Yerusalem, ka aimaimaun da asianut naka EJAKAIT, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka aioresio atiar: Kapaarasia kanun, ikamunete ituŋa itomon, kotoma aŋajepa kere nuka atekerin, ikamunete kito anapito naka ituŋanan kayeni-Yudayat, ebe, ‘Kiupar kayes, naarai kiira isio ebe ejai Edeke kayes.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
